## Objective

The objective of these experiments is to understand and implement fundamental **Agentic AI and LLM workflows locally using Ollama**. The experiments demonstrate SQL generation, information retrieval, question answering, and multi-step prompt processing.

## Local AI

These experiments use **Ollama with the Llama 3.2 model**, allowing the applications to run locally without requiring a cloud-based LLM API key.
